<!-- Settings 
     
     Evaluated per unique DeferredID/DeferredFlags combination.
     Settings can be inherited between IDs by applying multiple blocks with different tag conditions in order.
     
     Available tags:
      - 'DeferredID.xxx' - true for this deferred ID only
      - 'DeferredTag.xxx' - true for groups of deferred IDs tagged with this tag (specified in the deferred ID reflection)
      - 'DeferredFlag.xxx' - true for any material ID with this deferred flag (either the reflected base flags or added for a variant property)
      - 'Platform.xxx', 'Scenario.xxx', etc - general RenderDataManager tags
-->


